## Step 6: Risk & Simplicity Check

### What NOT to build right now

| Temptation | Why Skip |
|---|---|
| Day Ring / radial UI | Phase 2. Current linear timeline works. Focus on data + feedback loop first. |
| Composite daily score | Requires Laser module (focus ratings). Phase 2. |
| Day archetypes | Needs 2+ weeks of intention data to be meaningful. Phase 3. |
| Body Intelligence Score | Complex personalized algorithm. Phase 2-3. |
| Micro-reflections (pre/post meal hunger) | Extra friction for Phase 1. Add after users adopt intention-setting. |
| Recovery activities | Phase 2 Energise expansion. |
| Water tracking | Feature creep. Phase 2. |
| StoreKit / paywall | No premium features to gate yet. Phase 3. |
| Weekly insight UI | Code exists but surfacing it is Phase 2. Fix daily insight first. |
| `IntentionCategory` enum | Overengineering. Free-text intention is enough for Phase 1. |

